@VSATemplate_HostAddress = http://localhost:5206

### Get all products
GET {{VSATemplate_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get product by ID
GET {{VSATemplate_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create new product
POST {{VSATemplate_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "description": "High performance gaming laptop with RTX graphics",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stockQuantity": 15
}

###

### Create product with validation errors (should fail)
POST {{VSATemplate_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Test",
  "price": -10,
  "stockQuantity": -5
}

###

### Update product (replace {id} with actual product ID)
PUT {{VSATemplate_HostAddress}}/api/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Updated high performance gaming laptop",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "stockQuantity": 20
}

###

### Delete product (replace {id} with actual product ID)
DELETE {{VSATemplate_HostAddress}}/api/products/2

###

